OL,5,G1300 A Place in the Sun
OL,6,     FJesica and Karl dream of owning a
OL,7,     Fholiday home near Cadiz on Spain's
OL,8,     FCosta de la Luz. Jasmine Harman
OL,9,     Fshows them great places for their
OL,10,     F#95k. Are any of them perfect?
OL,11,G1400 A Place in the Sun
OL,12,     FDebra and Greg look for a holiday
OL,13,     Fhome in the beautiful countryside
OL,14,     Fof Murcia, which one day they hope
OL,15,     Fto make their permanent home.
OL,16,     FJasmine Harman shows them what
OL,17,     Ftheir #150k can buy.
OL,18,G1500 Come Dine with Me
OL,19,     FBury. The first host of the week,
